  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. AWS introduces new Amazon EventBridge Pipes which allow you to connect sources (SQS, Kinesis, DDB, Kafka, MQ) to Targets (14+ EventBridge Targets) without any code, with filtering, batching, input transformation, and an optional Enrichment stage (Lambda, StepFunctions, ApiGateway, ApiDestinations)",
